      "side": 1,
      "message": "Usually, we use Handler to prevent multi-threading issue, i.e. I think we do not usually use synchronized on handler? From the design in NSS, should we remove the protect of mStatsLock and noted that mDefaultNetworks/mLastNetworkStateSnapshots/mActiveIface should only be accessed in handler thread?(actually, I think they\u0027re handled in the handler thread, doesn\u0027t it?)",
      "range": {
